  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study for Farmforce in Indonesian coffee and cocoa sectors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a two-year feasibility study to explore market entry potential for Farmforce within the cocoa and coffee sectors in Indonesia. Farmforce is a digital traceability solution for smallholder farmer management, enabling trust and transparency in supply chains. The project will consist of a feasibility study to understand the market and identify potential customers to pilot the Farmforce solution with.</narrative>
  </description>
